  "citation": "Crystal-Ornelas R; Varadharajan C; Beilsmith K; Bond-Lamberty B; Boye K; Burrus M; Cholia S; Christianson D S; Crow M; Damerow J; Ely K S; Goldman A E; Heinz S; Hendrix V C; Kakalia Z; Mathes K; O'Brien F; O'Ryan D; Pennington S C; Robles E; Rogers A; Simmonds M; Velliquette T; Weisenhorn P; Welch J N; Whitenack K; Agarwal D (2022): Data from: \u201cEnabling FAIR data in Earth and environmental science with community-centric (meta)data reporting formats\u201d. Environmental Systems Science Data Infrastructure for a Virtual Ecosystem (ESS-DIVE). Dataset. doi:10.15485/1866606",
  "dataset": {
