    "citation": [
      "The most up-to-date documentation and templates for each of ESS-DIVE\u2019s data and metadata reporting formats can be found on our community GitHub space: https://github.com/ess-dive-community. Paper related to this dataset: Crystal-Ornelas et al. (In Revision). Enabling FAIR data in Earth and environmental science with community-centric (meta)data reporting formats. Published datasets containing documentation for each of the reporting formats: Agarwal, D. et al. ESS-DIVE Reporting Format for Dataset Package Metadata. (2022)doi:10.15485/1866026. Velliquette, T. et al. ESS-DIVE Reporting Format for File-level Metadata. (2021) doi:10.15485/1734840. Velliquette, T. et al. ESS-DIVE Reporting Format for Comma-separated Values (CSV) File Structure. (2021) doi:10.15485/1734841. Damerow, J. et al. ESS-DIVE global sample numbers and metadata reporting format for Environmental Systems Science (IGSN-ESS). (2020) doi:10.15485/1660470. Simmonds, M. B. et al. ESS-DIVE guidelines for archiving terrestrial model data. (2021) doi:10.15485/1813868. Crystal-Ornelas, R. et al. ESS-DIVE Reporting Format for Location Metadata. (2022) doi:10.15485/1865730. Weisenhorn, P. & Beilsmith, K. ESS-DIVE Reporting Format for Amplicon Abundance Tables. (2022) doi:10.15485/1865729. Ely, K. S., Rogers, A. & Crystal-Ornelas, R. ESS-DIVE reporting format for leaf-level gas exchange data and metadata. (2020) doi:10.15485/1659484.Bond-Lamberty, B., Christianson, D. S., Crystal-Ornelas, R., Mathes, K. & Pennington, S. C. ESS-DIVE reporting format for field measurements of soil respiration. (2021) doi:10.15485/1798520. Boye, K. et al. ESS-DIVE Reporting Format for Sample-based Water and Soil Chemistry Measurements. (2022) doi:10.15485/1865731 . Goldman, A. E., Ren, H., Torgeson, J. & Zhou, H. ESS-DIVE Reporting Format for Hydrologic Monitoring Data and Metadata. (2021) doi:10.15485/1822940.Peer-reviewed papers related to the reporting formats. Simmonds, M. B., Riley, W. J., Agarwal, D. A., Chen, X., Cholia, S., Crystal-Ornelas, R., et al. (2022). Guidelines for Publicly Archiving Terrestrial Model Data to Enhance Usability, Intercomparison, and Synthesis. Data Science Journal, 21(1). https://doi.org/10.5334/dsj-2022-003. Bond-Lamberty, B., Christianson, D. S., Crystal-Ornelas, R., Mathes, K., & Pennington, S. C. (2021). A reporting format for field measurements of soil respiration. Ecological Informatics, 101280. Damerow, J., Varadharajan, C., Boye, K., Brodie, E. L., Burrus, M., Chadwick, D. K., et al. (2021). Sample identifiers and metadata to support data management and reuse in multidisciplinary ecosystem sciences. Data Science Journal, 20, 1\u201319. Ely, K. S., Rogers, A., Agarwal, D. A., Ainsworth, E. A., Albert, L., Ali, A., et al. (2021). A reporting format for leaf-level gas exchange data and metadata. Ecological Informatics, 101232."
